lass":"","text":"A creature within 5 feet of the cube can take an action to pull a creature or object out of the cube. Doing so requires a successful DC 12 Strength check, and the creature making the attempt takes 10"},{"element":"span","class":"","text":"(3d6)"},{"element":"p","class":"","text":"acid damage."},{"element":"p","class":"","text":"The cube can hold only one Large creature or up to four Medium or smaller creatures inside it at a time."},{"element":"strong","class":"","text":"Transparent."},{"element":"p","class":"","text":"Even when the cube is in plain sight, it takes a successful DC 15 Wisdom ("},{"element":"a","class":"tooltip-hover skill-tooltip","text":"Perception"},{"element":"p","class":"","text":") check to spot a cube that has neither moved nor attacked. A creature that tries to enter the cube's space while unaware of the cube is surprised by the cube."},{"element":"div","class":"mon-stat-block__description-block-heading","text":"Actions"},{"element":"strong","class":"","text":"Pseudopod."},{"element":"em","class":"","text":"Melee Weapon Attack:"},{"element":"span","class":"","text":"+4"},{"element":"p","class":"","text":"to hit, reach 5 ft., one creature."},{"element":"em","class":"","text":"Hit:"},{"element":"p","class":"","text":"10"},{"element":"span","class":"","text":"(3d6)"},{"element":"p","class":"","text":"acid damage."},{"element":"strong","class":"","text":"Engulf."},{"element":"p","class":"","text":"The cube moves up to its speed. While doing so, it can enter Large or smaller creatures' spaces. Whenever the cube enters a creature's space, the creature must make a DC 12 Dexterity saving throw."},{"element":"p","class":"","text":"On a successful save, the creature can choose to be pushed 5 feet back or to the side of the cube. A creature that chooses not to be pushed suffers the consequences of a failed saving throw."},{"element":"p","class":"","text":"On a failed save, the cube enters the creature's space, and the creature takes 10"},{"element":"span","class":"","text":"(3d6)"},{"element":"p","class":"","text":"acid damage and is engulfed. The engulfed creature can't breathe, is"},{"element":"a","class":"tooltip-hover condition-tooltip","text":"restrained"},{"element":"p","class":"","text":", and takes 21"},{"element":"span","class":"","text":"(6d6)"},{"element":"p","class":"","text":"acid damage at the start of each of the cube's turns. When the cube moves, the engulfed creature moves with it."},{"element":"p","class":"","text":"An engulfed creature can try to escape by taking an action to make a DC 12 Strength check. On a success, the creature escapes and enters a space of its choice within 5 feet of the cube."}],"tags":117,"max_dom_depth":7}